    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d56">

                <pb facs="0118" n="38" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg38"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Vice-President Zanartu to the Vice-President of the United
                            States.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago, Chile</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The people of Chile and its Government are astounded by the apprehended issue of
                    the abominable attempt at Buffalo. May Your Excellency and the American people
                    be pleased to accept the most heartfelt condolences.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Anibal Zanartu</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Vice-President of Chile.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
